and damaging the grass. One big problem for grass is when the soil gets packed down too tightly. Viper Deck Protection mats help avoid this problem because they cover a wide area.<\/p>"}},"template--14498159001729__98e028a1-601b-4c5d-b26b-fc597b6d3a0c-16850334293c1835df-1":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"What is the weight capacity of the ground protection mats?","text":"<p>Ground Protection Mats are tested to handle pressure up to 210 psi, which means they can safely carry heavy weights of up to 80 tons. They work well on grassy fields, sandy areas, and mixed stone surfaces for different uses.<\/p>"}},"f1e6822d-3e21-4028-bb57-612c9a43439e":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Can I drive and use the Ground Protection Mats?","text":"<p>Yes, you can use our ground  Protection Mats on the ground, for protection and stability for all kinds of vehicles and loads. This includes big trucks, forklifts, backhoes, pickup trucks, and other heavy machines.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14498159001729__98e028a1-601b-4c5d-b26b-fc597b6d3a0c-16850334293c1835df-0","template--14498159001729__98e028a1-601b-4c5d-b26b-fc597b6d3a0c-16850334293c1835df-1","f1e6822d-3e21-4028-bb57-612c9a43439e"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"FAQs"}},"e4d9e90b-01c3-4c2a-8f70-5303e18201e1":{"type":"background-image-text","disabled":true,"custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px;}"],"settings":{"subtitle":"","title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.image_text_3_heading.value }}","text":"<p>{{ product.metafields.custom.image_text_3_description | metafield_tag }}<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","image":"{{ product.metafields.custom.promotion_grid_banner_image_1.value }}","focal_point":"center","layout":"right","height":550,"framed":false,"parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"49e1522d-4e00-4356-91df-3d3dbada5a3e":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize)